"d008/d067/f026"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "0e87675e",
"en_raw": "Excuse me"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "5c2e7d74",
"en_raw": "The famous strolling old man"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "cd1bca1b",
"en_raw": "is that you?"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "40c3960c",
"en_raw": "I don't know about famous"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "7edf6d86",
"en_raw": "I'm a strolling old man too"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "c9a2f337",
"en_raw": "To me, he gives more of"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "2e7b8a6a",
"en_raw": "a, how to put it, strange"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "278a0ed6",
"en_raw": "eccentric kind of image"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "22d63b05",
"en_raw": "How rude..."
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "03c6a567",
"en_raw": "But probably that's..."
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "6b636d51",
"en_raw": "You know him!?"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "b7262095",
"en_raw": "Well, no doubt it's"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "dc8352c0",
"en_raw": "about him"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "2ffd8cc3",
"en_raw": "Are you acquainted?"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "deefeac7",
"en_raw": "He and I have both always lived in Hirumi"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "e937faf0",
"en_raw": "Though lately he didn't seem"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "736c1148",
"en_raw": "to remember even my face..."
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "3fafbee3",
"en_raw": "That strolling old man"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "dd2d7a05",
"en_raw": "how's he doing lately?"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "09dde271",
"en_raw": "Who knows"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "13db6c6d",
"en_raw": "He's probably still keeping it up"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "dddd4314",
"en_raw": "the strolls on this Dusk Slope..."
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "a53eeb87",
"en_raw": "The lot behind the real estate office"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "03d986c4",
"en_raw": "Where the strolling old man"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "a0bf9895",
"en_raw": "always went"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "0e9b94ed",
"en_raw": "get lost?"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "dd0513d1",
"en_raw": "Who knows..."
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "fd2de740",
"en_raw": "Only that every day at the same time"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "1e88ee56",
"en_raw": "he went down the slope and"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "f05e4d52",
"en_raw": "climbed the big stairs, it seemed"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "cf70f837",
"en_raw": "Anyway, since it happened"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "d77b97cd",
"en_raw": "talking about it is painful"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "d2e4b691",
"en_raw": "I naturally kept"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "67c0a98a",
"en_raw": "my distance"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "0e87675e",
"en_raw": "Excuse me"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "d62787da",
"en_raw": "by Hirumi Station's north exit"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "419ab72d",
"en_raw": "do you know it?"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "849715a1",
"en_raw": "I found a narrow, strange grave"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "4fa05dc6",
"en_raw": "There was a grave"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "e4e0f69c",
"en_raw": "Long ago there certainly was"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "2b9d7d1a",
"en_raw": "a small temple around there"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "36d966ad",
"en_raw": "Is the grave still there?"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "de09032e",
"en_raw": "marked Yamamoto"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "3509d7d5",
"en_raw": "Do you know it?"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "5f0dd723",
"en_raw": "Oh, it's still"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "83c99e6b",
"en_raw": "there, is it"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "ad6cbcf1",
"en_raw": "Who is it? Who's Yamamoto?"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "2238bbeb",
"en_raw": "The croquette shop, right?"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "f1ff13ae",
"en_raw": "There's a deli in front"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "8c7ae469",
"en_raw": "of the middle school, right?"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "6d38e3fd",
"en_raw": "The croquette shop"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "f1f95094",
"en_raw": "It's that family's grave"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "5dfa7483",
"en_raw": "is Takagiya, isn't it?"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "613cab61",
"en_raw": "Lately it's all about the croquette shop"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "7e54aaba",
"en_raw": "Takagi is a shop name"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "4a1d8729",
"en_raw": "the store's name"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "f644381d",
"en_raw": "But that family's surname"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "0530d172",
"en_raw": "is Yamamoto"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "e75a42f0",
"en_raw": "but"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "06645d59",
"en_raw": "are you tricking me?"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "407673ce",
"en_raw": "I don't know what you mean"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "12cac85f",
"en_raw": "Somehow..."
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "6e94ba11",
"en_raw": "The old man there..."
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "19ee437d",
"en_raw": "Mr. Yamamoto is a friend of mine"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "892db0b0",
"en_raw": "but I believe his first son"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "7c613102",
"en_raw": "died of illness as a child"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "63b86df8",
"en_raw": "If any grave remains"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "686826e3",
"en_raw": "it might be that one..."
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "00b8db02",
"en_raw": "I don't really get it"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "57729292",
"en_raw": "The owner of the croquette shop"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "57efe007",
"en_raw": "you kids often go to"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "8bd1d9f6",
"en_raw": "is, so"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "5cb2f3cc",
"en_raw": "Mr. Yamamoto's"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "7e77a7ef",
"en_raw": "second son"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "68957346",
"en_raw": "More importantly, that old man"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "eda3f21d",
"en_raw": "how is he now?"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "467fabea",
"en_raw": "Are the croquettes there"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "625cfd96",
"en_raw": "any good?"
}
]
}